Appendix: Gold-set drafting form


&lt;label class="form-label"&gt;Question&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;input type="text" class="form-control" id="q-text" placeholder="e.g. anak saya tolak makan sebab tak reti nak minta, apa nak buat?"&gt;


&lt;div class="col"&gt;
  &lt;label class="form-label"&gt;Gold chunk ids (comma separated)&lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;input type="text" class="form-control" id="q-gold" placeholder="e.g. a9aab0e9_1, 7a2ee7cf_1"&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="col"&gt;
  &lt;label class="form-label"&gt;Test type&lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;select class="form-select" id="q-type"&gt;
    &lt;option&gt;multi-hop&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option&gt;hard-paraphrase&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option&gt;cross-lingual&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option&gt;near-miss adversarial&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option&gt;refusal&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option&gt;paraphrase&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;/select&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;div class="col"&gt;
  &lt;label class="form-label"&gt;Lang&lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;select class="form-select" id="q-lang"&gt;
    &lt;option&gt;ms&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;en&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;rojak&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;/select&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="col"&gt;
  &lt;label class="form-label"&gt;Notes&lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;input type="text" class="form-control" id="q-notes" placeholder="what failure mode this targets"&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


